{"displayStem":"재태39주 신생아가 생후4일에 수유 상담을 받았다. 최근24시간 수유 횟수는12회였다. 아래 체중은 같은 보정 저울로 잰 값이다.","notes":[{"kind":"provenance","text":"직접 설계한 교육용 합성 자료"}],"evidenceMarkup":["<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C06 c06-batch\"><div class=\"evidence\"><div class=\"measurement-panels\"><figure class=\"measurement-panel\"><figcaption>같은 저울로 측정한 체중</figcaption><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 580 355\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"같은 저울로 측정한 체중。생후 일수 (day)、체중 (kg)\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"580\" height=\"355\" fill=\"white\"></rect><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"45\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"526\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"20\" y=\"25\">체중 (kg)</text><line x1=\"76\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"76\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0</text><line x1=\"186\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"186\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"186\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">2</text><line x1=\"296\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"296\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"296\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">4</text><line x1=\"406\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"406\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"406\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">6</text><line x1=\"516\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"516\" y2=\"234\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"516\" y=\"255\" text-anchor=\"middle\">8</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"229\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"229\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"234\" text-anchor=\"end\">2.7</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"185.49999999999997\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"185.49999999999997\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"190.49999999999997\" text-anchor=\"end\">2.93</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"141.99999999999994\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"141.99999999999994\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"146.99999999999994\" text-anchor=\"end\">3.15</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"98.50000000000003\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"98.50000000000003\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"103.50000000000003\" text-anchor=\"end\">3.38</text><line x1=\"71\" y1=\"55\" x2=\"76\" y2=\"55\" stroke=\"black\"></line><text x=\"65\" y=\"60\" text-anchor=\"end\">3.6</text><polyline points=\"76,93.66666666666671 186,140.06666666666666 296,167.13333333333335\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.3\" stroke-dasharray=\"none\"></polyline><circle cx=\"76\" cy=\"93.66666666666671\" r=\"2.1\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"186\" cy=\"140.06666666666666\" r=\"2.1\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"296\" cy=\"167.13333333333335\" r=\"2.1\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><circle cx=\"85\" cy=\"301\" r=\"3\" fill=\"white\" stroke=\"black\"></circle><text x=\"97\" y=\"306\">체중</text><text x=\"300\" y=\"282\" text-anchor=\"middle\">생후 일수 (day)</text></svg></figure></div></div></div>","<div class=\"dataset-evidence batch-C06 c06-batch\"><div class=\"evidence\"><table><thead><tr><th>최근24시간</th><th>기록</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>삼킴·젖 전달</td><td>관찰 시 삼킴 드묾</td></tr><tr><td>소변 / 대변</td><td>소변2회, 태변 지속</td></tr><tr><td>진찰</td><td>입안 건조, 자극 시 깨지만 쉽게 잠듦</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div>"]}